# Research notes (`docs/`)

This repo has a **`docs/`** directory with markdown research notes from building the Mad-Dog Everettianism simulator. Consult these for physics context, measured results, and design rationale before guessing.

Start at `docs/README.md` for the index. Topics include emergent space/time, holography tests, TFIM parameters (`h`, `J`), the 3+1 Universe Lab, and open questions.

These are **working learnings** (what the code does and what `sim-check` showed), not claims of new physics. Update `docs/` when experiments or behavior change materially.
